"20260702210527899202_7829a145", "type": "Claim", "text": "By December 2025, 
China had recorded 744 investment events in embodied intelligence and robotics, 
with an aggregate disclosed financing amount of approximately 73.543 billion 
RMB, reflecting rapid capital inflows into the domestic embodied AI ecosystem.",
"source_ids": ["20260702205532060585_79b003ca"], "citations": [6], "sources": 
[{"source_id": "20260702205532060585_79b003ca", "title": "[PDF] 具身智能发展报告
