"source_type": "report", "published_at": null}]}, {"id": 
"20260702210528383209_707caf9e", "type": "Claim", "text": "SoftBank Robotics 
Group is portrayed as a leading player in the embodied AI market, heavily 
investing in embodied AI research focused on human–robot interaction, cognitive 
learning, and emotional intelligence, and offering a portfolio of embodied AI 
products including humanoid robots (Pepper, NAO) and various cleaning and 
delivery robots (Whiz, Scrubber, RS26, Keenbot, Servi, Delivery X1, BellaBot, 
KittyBot), which are applied mainly in service and healthcare contexts.", 
"source_ids": ["20260702205532099715_cc21568c"], "citations": [7], "sources": 
