"official", "published_at": null}]}, {"id": "20260702210528573454_40c7734a", 
"type": "Claim", "text": "ABB is described as a major embodied AI company and 
global robotics and automation leader whose strategic route in embodied AI 
emphasizes organic growth via innovation, portfolio diversification, and 
intelligent automation, focusing on AI-integrated robots such as GoFa 
collaborative robots to deliver enhanced autonomy, precision, and adaptability 
in dynamic industrial environments across sectors like automotive, aerospace, 
construction, and healthcare.", "source_ids": ["20260702205532099715_cc21568c"],
"citations": [7], "sources": [{"source_id": "20260702205532099715_cc21568c", 
