"official", "published_at": null}]}, {"id": "20260702210528728939_8c2552cb", 
"type": "Claim", "text": "Toyota Research Institute (TRI) has pursued an 
embodied AI technical route that evolved from teleoperated partner robots to 
large behavior models: following the 2017 T-HR3 teleoperated humanoid robot that
mirrored operator motions via 5G, TRI has since 2023 focused on training \"Large
Behaviour Models\" as robot foundation models using thousands of 
human-demonstrated tasks in simulated kitchens and labs, aiming for robots that 
\"augment rather than replace\" humans in home and laboratory tasks such as 
dishwashing, food preparation, and sample handling.", "source_ids": 
["20260702205420629658_38452154"], "citations": [5], "sources": [{"source_id": 
