manoid-robots", "source_type": "blog", "published_at": "2025-07-14"}]}, {"id": 
"20260702210528834642_2f66c0c0", "type": "Claim", "text": "Sanctuary AI follows 
a cognitive-architecture-based embodied AI route for industrial humanoids: its 
Phoenix humanoid (about 1.7 m, 70 kg, with 20 degrees of freedom per hand) 
employs a proprietary embodied cognitive architecture that mimics human movement
and cognition, uses sim-to-real transfer via NVIDIA Isaac Lab, and has executed 
paid shifts in retail, e-commerce fulfillment, and light manufacturing since 
2024, initially via teleoperation and gradually transitioning to autonomous task
execution with its own cognitive system.", "source_ids": 
["20260702205420629658_38452154", "20260702205532187765_2a5d581a"], "citations":
[5, 9], "sources": [{"source_id": "20260702205420629658_38452154", "title": "21 
