"20260702210529382326_14b877fb", "type": "Claim", "text": "Tesla’s embodied AI 
route centers on the Optimus humanoid integrated with its existing AI and 
compute infrastructure: after announcing its entry into humanoid robots at AI 
Day 2021, Tesla’s AI division in Austin—also responsible for FSD and the Dojo 
supercomputer—provides training compute for Optimus, which by early 2026 has 
been internally deployed in Fremont and several Gigafactories for tasks such as 
battery cell handling to collect real-world training data, though Tesla has not 
yet publicly committed to a clear timeline for delivering Optimus to external 
customers.", "source_ids": ["20260702205532060585_79b003ca"], "citations": [6], 
