headquartered in Waltham and acquired by Hyundai for about US$1.1 billion, is 
considered one of the most experienced humanoid-robot firms (30+ years in 
robotics) and, by 2026, has allocated shipments for its pilot-stage electric 
Atlas humanoid, representing a route focused on advanced dynamic locomotion and 
