"http://www.caict.ac.cn/kxyj/qwfb/bps/202601/P020260130541978285206.pdf", 
"source_type": "report", "published_at": null}]}, {"id": 
"20260702210527613940_a74d4724", "type": "Claim", "text": "A 
MarketsandMarkets-style industry report segments the global embodied AI market 
by product type into robots (including humanoid robots, mobile robots, 
industrial robots, service robots, and collaborative robots), exoskeletons, 
autonomous systems, and smart appliances, and introduces a three-level \"level 
of embodiment\" classification (Level 1–3) while forecasting market growth from 
about US$4.44 billion in 2025 to US$23.06 billion in 2030 (39% CAGR).", 
"source_ids": ["20260702205532099715_cc21568c"], "citations": [7], "sources": 
