"20260702210528206224_643aeb21", "type": "Claim", "text": "One analysis 
highlights the synergy among multimodal large models (MM-LL
   1.5  Ms), world models, and embodied AI as a core technical route toward AGI,
arguing that MM-LLMs solve single-modality perception limits by fusing text, 
images, and speech, world models provide predictive internal representations of 
environment dynamics, and embodied AI closes the loop by executing 
perception–decision–action in the physical world, jointly shifting AI from 
single to multi-dimensional perception and from passive cognition to active 
prediction.", "source_ids": ["20260702205532099715_cc21568c"], "citations": [7],
